Hi Avery,

Here's what's new in Figma this month.

Variables, extended
Variables now support expressions, so a spacing token can be defined as 2x another. Mode switching (light/dark, compact/comfortable) works across nested components without detaching.

Developer handoff, included
Every seat on your plan now includes the handoff view: inspect specs, copy CSS/iOS/Android code, and compare changes between versions. No add-on required.

Slides improvements
Presenter notes, speaker view, and export to PDF with links preserved.

FigJam
New voting stickers, a timer that follows you between boards, and templates for retros and sprint planning.

See everything that shipped: https://mail.figma.com/l/whats-new-0828

Happy designing,
